      "content": "Telling the board the current build is \"ready for competitive play\" would be a misrepresentation given the excessive win rates observed in high-Elo brackets. While revenue spikes are tempting, launching a fundamentally unbalanced character creates a risk of toxic community backlash that often outweighs short-term financial gains. A better approach is to release a low-risk balance patch alongside the marketing campaign to address the insecurity without deferring critical fixes.",
